<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14044" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dī-nŭmĕro</span></b> ,
			āvi, ātum, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to count over,
				reckon up, enumerate</i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen. (class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stellas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Off. 1, 43, 154</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rep. 2, 15</span></i>
			; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">horas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 73, 75, § 185</span></i>
			: tempora, * <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 6, 691</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">noctes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 11, 574 al.</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">syllabas (c. c. dimetiri),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Or. 43, 147</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spoliata templa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint.
					6, 1, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">exercitum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					4, 11, 18, § 43</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">generis gradus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. F.
					2, 622</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">centuriat Capuae, dinumerat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 16, 9 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			Plaut. and Ter. in partic., mercantile t. t., <i>to
				count out, pay out</i> money: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">argentum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Ep. 1, 1, 68</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 1, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">31</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hibus stipendium,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Mil. 1, 1, 74</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">viginti minas illi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Ad. 5, 7, 17</span></i>
			.</div>
